Z||000002||maryjane||09-27-2001||01:05 PM||||Nice poem. I LIKE it. Since this thread is already open, here's something I got last weekend: A Whole New Ball Game.<P>To Ossama Bin Laden, Hammas,Islamic Extremists,Terrorists... Et Al<BR>We here in the U.S. are happy to report we unequivically accept your invitation to an old-fasshioned, no-holds-barred game of whup ass. Now that we under stand that the rules of the game are that there aren't any, we  look forward to playing by them for the first time. While we admit you are off to an impressive lead, it is now OUR turn at the plate. Just to remind you, The next inning will be in YOUR ballpark!<BR>Batter up, A**ho*es!||||reg||1
